DELIBERATELY NOT PROPOSED IN THIS WAVE (each would move exit semantics while the counter
is frozen): failClosed('NO_VERDICTS', ...) when unreadable === counted; and a distinct
transition for "gate self-reported a FAIL_CLOSED verdict word" so NEW_RED stops mixing
"newly red" with "newly unreadable". Either needs the frozen probe re-read first.
